"""TechAid IO / Mood — glass desktop edition.

Setup: run Setup_Mood.bat with Python 3.12 installed.
Run: Run_Mood.bat. Build Windows app: Build_Mood.bat.
Voice: free local Kokoro Heart; models belong in the voices subfolder.

The interface HTML/CSS/JS is embedded below: no external website, CDN or fonts.
Saved chats remain in the same TechAidIO SQLite database as earlier versions.
"""

